  "mathematical_review": [
    "The local cumulative recurrence hG follows by expanding the new loss term and retaining the signed change of regularizer.",
    "The local hmain induction proves the exact n+1-prefix telescope for the fixed arbitrary spliced sequence y; the base case expands one summand and the induction step preserves both the drift sum and the terminal G gap.",
    "Positive hT permits n=T-1 and T-1+1=T; y T=z then supplies the arbitrary terminal point. T=1 has empty drift. T=0 is not claimed.",
    "All psi/loss values are arbitrary finite reals, with arbitrary carrier, x,u,z. There is no optimizer, convexity, monotonicity, support, norm, or sign restriction hidden in the proof.",
    "The final positive G(T-1,z)-G(T-1,u) remains explicit; the proof does not establish the source cancellation or corrected sharp bounds of whole Eq7.47/15.31."
  ],
